# Setup
1. Make sure you have the following installed:
    a. python 3.10.0
    b. postgresql 15.8

2. Create virtual environment
`python -m venv {venv_name}`

3. Create database
    a. Go into psql shell
        `psql -U postgres;`
    b. Create Database
        `CREATE DATABASE wingz_local;`

4. Install requirements
`pip install -r requirements.txt`

5. Run seeder
`python manage.py seed_data_01 --users 10 --rides 1000`

6. Run server
python manage.py runserver

